FLOOR 4 of 9 - THE MINESHAFT

Herobrine buried a single diamond somewhere in this world.
The world is the whole filesystem, not only your home folder.

What you know about the diamond:
  - the file is owned by the user herobrine
  - the file is exactly 33 bytes in size

Herobrine left a lot of worthless ore lying around, and many places
in this world will refuse to let you look inside.
The diamond holds the password for locstd04.
